OL,3,AEnding corridor care in hospitals for
OL,4,Achildren will be a priority, says
OL,5,Ahealth secretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe NHS must take urgent action to stop
OL,8,Fchildren receiving treatment in
OL,9,Fhospital corridors, Health Secretary
OL,10,FYvette Cooper has told the BBC.
OL,12,FCooper told the BBC's Sunday with Laura
OL,13,FKuenssberg she has asked NHS England to
OL,14,Fdraw up urgent plans to eliminate what
OL,15,Fis known as "corridor care" for
OL,16,Fchildren as a priority, and to
OL,17,Fintroduce new standards for how
OL,18,Fchildren should be treated at A&E.
OL,20,FIt comes after more than a dozen health
OL,21,Fgroups urged the health secretary to
OL,22,Ftake action to end corridor care.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/37
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
